            "question": "Who we are",
            "answer": "<p>Stendig Calendars is operated by Tipo Designs Ltd, a company registered in England and Wales (company number 12172308).</p><p>Registered address: 47 Keeling House, Claredale St, London, E2 6PG, United Kingdom<br/>Email: <a href=\"mailto:help@stendigcalendars.com\">help@stendigcalendars.com</a></p><p>These terms apply to consumers. If you are buying for business purposes, such as wholesale or resale, please contact us for our wholesale terms, which apply instead.</p>"
