        "question_YcrcBL": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Placing an order",
            "answer": "<p>When you place an order, you will receive an email acknowledging that we have received it. This is not acceptance of your order. Our contract with you is formed when we send you an email confirming that your order has been dispatched.</p><p>We may decline or cancel an order before dispatch, for example if an item is out of stock, if we identify a pricing or product description error, or if we cannot verify payment. If we do, we will let you know and refund any amount you have paid in full.</p>"
