          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Products",
            "answer": "<p>We make every effort to display our products accurately, but colours may vary slightly depending on your screen, and minor variations can occur between print runs. These variations are a normal characteristic of offset-printed products and do not constitute a fault.</p>"
