        "question_famWH8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Prices and payment",
            "answer": "<p>Prices are shown in the currency of your selected market and include VAT or sales tax where we are required to collect it. Delivery charges are shown separately at checkout before you pay.</p><p>Payment is taken in full when you place your order. We accept the payment methods shown at checkout. All payments are processed securely by our payment providers.</p><p>If we discover a genuine pricing error in an order you have placed, we will contact you and give you the option of confirming the order at the correct price or cancelling it for a full refund.</p>"
