        "question_PMCUnf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Customs and import duties",
            "answer": "<p>Depending on your country, your order may be subject to import duties, taxes, or customs fees. Where these are included in your order total or collected by us at checkout, this will be clearly shown. Where they are not, they are your responsibility and are payable to the carrier or customs authority on or before delivery. Refusing a delivery because of customs charges is treated as a cancellation under section 7, and any costs or unrecoverable charges we incur may be deducted from your refund.</p>"
          }
